==Strategy==
The Killer Axe Base can pose a threat here, especially in higher magnifications, as it harms in a large area while doing high damage to your units. Thus, it is recommended to bring bulky or quick units to this stage, like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kendo Cat]]. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] is very useful here, dealing Massive Damage to Darks while being able to survive many hits from the Killer Gross Cats. Killer Cowbird Cat isn't much of a problem, simply acting as Killer Cat with more range.

